WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.720
Yesterday Melania Trump unveiled her official campaign

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:04.553
as First Lady.

3
00:00:04.553 --> 00:00:06.090
A lot of people talking about this.

4
00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:07.790
It's an initiative encouraging kids

5
00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:10.480
to make good decisions called Be Best.

6
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.890
Here's a photo from her press conference.

7
00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:16.720
And yeah, some people are already saying

8
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.490
that Be Best is an odd choice of title and theme,

9
00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:23.200
but Mrs. Trump actually went through a lot of other options

10
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.853
before she landed on Be Best.

11
00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.690
Here are just a couple that didn't make the cut.

12
00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:32.340
For example, a literacy program called Hello Here Book.

13
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.310
That was one.
(audience laughs)

14
00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:35.143
Yeah.

15
00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:39.575
She had a fitness program called America Fat Stop No.

16
00:00:39.575 --> 00:00:42.100
(audience laughs)

17
00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.203
A pet adoption program called Look It Dog.

18
00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:49.260
And finally an abstinence only program

19
00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:51.960
called Insert There Not There.

20
00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.718
(audience laughs)

21
00:00:53.718 --> 00:00:56.635
(audience cheers)

